But he's only just... A LITTLE GUY 
Submitted to the HC Jame Gam 2026

https://requiemsbullet.itch.io/but-hes-only-just-a-little-guy
[ Playable in browser, for downloads download directly from the itch.io page, extract the rar file and open the application. ]

But he's only just a... A LITTLE GUY is about a very small little guy who wishes to climb over the big guy mountain, he must eat foods to get bigger in order to fight off the big guys on the other side. 

Controls : Arrow keys & WASD for movement, E to interact for dialogue , ESC to pause , and R to restart. 
There are currently 6 endings within the game, including one that shuts down the game. This is intentional, not a bug. 

Programming, Assets, Story writing : KlownEris , RequiemsBullet
Audio Design : KlownEris
Menu Design : RequiemsBullet
